<body class="">
    <!-- @import '../header.kit' -->
    <div class="main">
        <div class="project-intro typewriter">
            <div class="project-intro-inner">
                <h1 class="project-title" data-chars="1" data-speed="50">Black Swan 2020 Season Campaign</h1>
                <hr>
                <div class="project-details-wrapper">
                    <div class="project-details">
                        <h2>Client</h2>
                        <p>Black Swan State Theatre Company of Western Australia</p>

                        <h2>Involvement</h2>
                        <p>Campaign Identity </p>
                        <p>Signage</p>
                        <p>Digital Communications</p>
                        <p>Social Media Content </p>
                        <p>Advertising</p>
                        <p>Program Design</p>
                        <p>Video</p>

                        <h2>Credits</h2>
                        <p>Portrait Photography — <a href="https://www.samharrisphoto.com.au/" target="_blank">Sam&nbsp;Harris</a></p>

                        <div class="awards">
                            <h2>Recognition</h2>
                            <p><a href="https://agda.com.au/awards/results/1201/" target="_blank">AGDA Awards 2020 Finalist — Typography for Design</a></p>
                            <p><a href="https://agda.com.au/awards/results/1167/" target="_blank">AGDA Awards 2021 Finalist — Print Campaigns</a></p>
                            <p>Award Awards 2021 Finalist — Design: Campaign</p>
                            <p>PADC Skull Awards 2021 — Gold x 1, Silver x 3</p>
                            <p><a href="https://www.commarts.com/exhibit/black-swan-state-theatre-company" target="_blank">Featured on Communication Arts</a></p>

                            <div class="awards-logos wait-for-typewriter">
                                <img alt="PADC Skull" title="PADC Skull" src="/assets/award-skull.svg">
                                <img alt="AGDA Award" title="AGDA Award" src="/assets/award-agda.svg">
                                <img alt="AWARD Award" title="AWARD Award" src="/assets/award-award.svg">
                                <img alt="Communication Arts" title="Communication Arts" src="/assets/award-communication-arts.svg">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        <h2>Challenge</h2>
                        <p>For Black Swan State Theatre Company’s 2020 season, Artistic Director Clare Watson had programmed a diverse suite of productions that looked at universal themes through a distinctly Western Australian lens.</p>
                        <h2>Solution</h2>
                        <p>Fittingly, the 2020 Season campaign, Stories from Here, was created to take audiences on a road trip around Western Australia, from the forest community of Manjimup to the historic inland town of York, the West Australian outback or the suburban streets of Perth.</p>
                        <p>To launch Stories from Here, I worked with Block to recruit seven emerging photographers to capture a mix of landscapes, from outer-suburbia to the beach and&nbsp;bush.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        
                        
                        <p>The campaign takes inspiration from scrapbooks, travel journals, road directories and, even old telephone books, with colour sampled directly from the land: it’s designed to feel very inclusive and approachable, as theatre should be.</p>
                        <p>Along with working across the campaign, directing the portrait photography, and designing the season guide — I also shot and produced the season trailer.</p>
                        <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H14J1Vznv5E" target="_blank" class="dotted after-arrow">Watch the season trailer</a></p>

                        
                        <div class="collab-logos wait-for-typewriter">
                            <img alt="Cameron Murray" title="Cameron Murray" src="/assets/logo-cameron-murray.svg">
                            <img alt="Block Branding" title="Block Branding" src="/assets/logo-block.svg">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
